cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article below."
title: "Phylogeny shapes BGC content and prophage dynamics in Virgibacillus: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a comparative genomic study of the 138 publicly available isolate genomes
  deposited under the name Virgibacillus, covering GTDB reclassification, clone-group
  dereplication, BGC prediction and gene cluster families, tests of phylogenetic structure in
  cluster content, ancestral state reconstruction, the pangenome of GTDB Virgibacillus, and
  prophage detection and prophage-host divergence.
type: software
license: MIT
